Strategic Simulations, Inc.)"}, "developer": false}, {"id": 370862, "company": {"id": 201, "name": "Cyberlore Studios"}, "developer": true}, {"id": 370863, "company": {"id": 1029, "name": "Softgold Computerspiele GmbH"}, "developer": false}, {"id": 370864, "company": {"id": 3491, "name": "GOG.com"}, "developer": false}, {"id": 370865, "company": {"id": 16121, "name": "SEG interactive"}, "developer": false}], "name": "Al-Qadim: The Genie's Curse", "platforms": [3, 6, 14, 13], "player_perspectives": [{"id": 3, "name": "Bird view / Isometric"}], "release_dates": [{"id": 866654, "date": 1442448000, "platform": 6, "y": 2015, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 869632, "date": 1442448000, "platform": 3, "y": 2015, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 869628, "date": 788832000, "platform": 13, "y": 1994, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 869629, "date": 788832000, "platform": 13, "y": 1994, "release_region": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}, {"id": 869630, "date": 1648512000, "platform": 6, "y": 2022, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 869631, "date": 1442448000, "platform": 14, "y": 2015, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 21861, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/grcrv7mqfymqah1jqchz.jpg"}, {"id": 21860, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/xprcwmtm0nqpgiwoesqa.jpg"}, {"id": 21864, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ac7zkhdsuqankpf04tsc.jpg"}, {"id": 21863, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/zhscnzsvztbm6riobgcy.jpg"}, {"id": 21862, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/hsajuotueo0hghwnuiid.jpg"}], "slug": "al-qadim-the-genie-s-curse", "storyline": "As the youngest son of a Noble Merchant, an easy life lay before you. But the call of adventure beckoned, and so, you left your home for a life of action and danger. Sea serpents, storms and tattered sails have all proved perilous as the years passed. You've taken ships and defeated fiends, at the side of your instructor, the Master Corsair Sinbar.\n\nBut your thoughts always return to Kara, the Caliph's beautiful daughter. It is for her you devote your skill and honors. And it will be her hand in marriage that will be your reward for attaining your goal of becoming a Corsair. Your adventure begins now, on the hidden isle where Sinbar tests his pupils.", "summary": "Al Qadim: The Genie's Curse features a new and improved interface and game engine. The perspective is that of a slant-overhead view that allows you to guide your character through the adventure. In comparison the view and scrolling are much better than those of Ultima series. The game as based on the AD&D 2nd Edition rules and is enriched by exiting new concepts, spells, and creatures designed especially for this campaign setting. You play a single fighter type character. Swordplay is enhanced to a semi-arcade level with an ability to learn up to three specific combat moves.\n\nThose combat moves become available as you increase in level and find a trainer willing to teach them to you. The bestiary is close to standard but even the classic creatures are tainted with a touch of Arabian exoticism making each and every battle a new", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/al-qadim-the-genie-s-curse", "videos": [{"id": 8248, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "nSSoA5j5Lfo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nSSoA5j5Lfo", "title": "DOS - Al-Qadim The Genies Curse (1994, Cyberlore Studios)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nSSoA5j5Lfo/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 3395, "name": "Dungeons & Dragons"}]}